# Experiment artifacts land here, one timestamped pair per run:
#
#   learning_2026-07-30_14-42-18.json   full structure
#   learning_2026-07-30_14-42-18.csv    flat rows for plotting
#
# Results are committed on purpose. A measurement nobody can find later is a
# measurement that has to be paid for again, and the free tier has a daily cap.
#
# Every artifact carries an `outcome` field. INVALID runs are written too --
# knowing the provider was rate limited at a given time is context, not noise.
